It was introduced as per Java 5 as part of java.util.concurrent package to simplify development of concurrent application by abstracting away many of the complexities involved in creating and managing threads.

Problems prior to Executors Framework

1. Manual Thread Management
2. Resource management
3. Scalability
4. Thread reuse
5. Error Handling

Executors Framework

1. Executor
2. ExecutorService
3. ScheduledExecutorService